    skills: {"en":"Engineering, perseverance against doubt, French culture, architecture.","de":"Ingenieurskunst, Beharrlichkeit, französische Kultur, Architektur.","fr":"Ingénierie, persévérance, culture française, architecture.","it":"Ingegneria, perseveranza contro lo scetticismo, cultura francese, architettura."},
