    skills: {"en":"Democracy, equality, peaceful protest, perseverance.","de":"Demokratie, Gleichheit, friedlicher Protest, Ausdauer.","fr":"Démocratie, égalité, protestation pacifique, persévérance.","it":"Democrazia, uguaglianza, protesta pacifica, perseveranza."},
