    skills: {"en":"Archaeology, Roman history, volcanoes, historical preservation.","de":"Archäologie, römische Geschichte, Vulkane, historische Erhaltung.","fr":"Archéologie, histoire romaine, volcans, préservation historique.","it":"Archeologia, storia romana, vulcani, conservazione storica."},
